  "body": "I just tested nightly version **ART_9ac5ad5_Win64.exe** and also in this case, as soon as I run it after its installation, it gave the same message I had yesterday with the version **ART_1d40780_Win64.exe**.\nIn this case however I paid more attention to the starting process and I noticed that 4-5 different messages appear on the screen in sequence, before process aborted. They were in order of apparition:\n\n<img width=\"413\" height=\"159\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/d2df956b-799b-4fab-bb68-46f4b05d9ed1\" />\n\n<img width=\"413\" height=\"159\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/76dff5c5-359e-44fa-a637-01fec655f9ed\" />\n\n<img width=\"413\" height=\"159\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/88ac24c6-4940-4647-9ed5-c479ca3de99e\" />\n\n<img width=\"413\" height=\"159\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/c6e4ba05-b543-4835-ad1e-ab233fe3ae3d\" />\n\nBeside, please note that the 3rd and 4th dialog box can appear in the sequence as n.3 beforen. 4 or viceversa, \n\nSometimes, it appears also a different dialog box, which I report below:\n\n<img width=\"413\" height=\"159\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/3aa610de-e8f0-468f-beec-1bda14a4972c\" />\n\nAs previously, as soon as I reinstalled version 1.25.9, then program start to work fine.\n\nRegards,\nTopoldo",
